      "text": "Overview\nGenerative models\n    - VAEs\n    - GANS\n    - Auto-regressive Transformers\n    - Diffusion Models\nText-to-image\n    - Data preparation\n    - Model architecture (Unet, DiT, etc.)\n    - Forward and backward process\n    - Sampling process\nText-to-video\n    - Latent diffusion models\n    - Compression models\n    - Super-resolution models",
