      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751749168562,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "image generation is formulated as a sequence generation task, each part of an image is generated\nsequentially. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "image generation is formulated as a sequence generation task, each part of an image is generated sequentially. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dXFTXnZQ0nNvmG1MK6Zvc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1907.4015271391327,
      "y": -330.6514921960219,
      "width": 1177.718200683594,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bTM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1682259667,
      "version": 90,
      "versionNonce": 1255358301,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751749265910,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Diffusion models formulate image generation as an iterative process. \n\nA neural network iteratively denoises an image, transforming the noise into a meaningful image.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
